7	%
8	% DESCRIPTION:
9	% Perform spectral registration in the time domain to correct frequency and
10	% phase drifts in a restricted region.
11	%
12	% INPUTS:
13	% in        = Input data structure.
14	% seqType   = Type of used sequence. Options: 'unedited', 'MEGA', 'HERMES',
15	%             'HERCULES'
